  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "どれどれ……お、トナカイにしたのか\r\nマフラーがワンポイントになってて可愛いな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700050020,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ほんと？　やったー！\r\nわたしチョイスのマフラーです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170005/4901700050020"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700050030,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "実はね、ちょっと期待してトナカイにしたんだ\r\nコラボできるかもって思って！",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170005/4901700050030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "コラボ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700050040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "そう！　ソリの飾りの人がいたら、\r\n『ソリを引くトナカイ』にできるかもだし──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170005/4901700050040"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700050050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "サンタさんの飾りの人がいたら、\r\n『トナカイの手綱を引くサンタさん』ができそうだなって！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "special_communications/490170005/4901700050050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "なるほど、それは面白いな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4901700050060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "でしょでしょ？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
